{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302200","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130220001:1":{"text":"음... 이번 군가 축제 전까진 그랬지.","source_cn":"嗯……在这届战歌节前，确实如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A444A5B2CC70C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130220002:1":{"text":"그렇지만 난 최강자에게 계속해서 도전하는 오우거가 더 좋아.","source_cn":"可我还是更喜欢不停挑战所谓最强者的奥格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF3D5E841093375F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130220003:1":{"text":"강한 사람도 물론 존경받아 마땅하지만, 난 포기하지 않는 끈기있는 전사가 더 마음에 들더라고.","source_cn":"强者固然令人尊敬，但我更喜欢，永不言弃的勇士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A2B25AB045FACA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血迪拉夫":{"text":"딜라프","source":"蛮血迪拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}